nter;\">All <\/div><\/div><\/td><td style=\"word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;\"><div><div style=\"text-align:center;\">&gt; 60 <\/div><\/div><\/td><td colspan=\"3\" style=\"word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;\"><div>The fastening system shall resist the wind forces in 1609.5.3.<\/div><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><tfoot><tr><td><\/td><td><\/td><td><\/td><td><\/td><td><\/td><\/tr><\/tfoot><\/table><\/div><\/ScrollTable>",
